[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842874758","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115832#issuecomment-3842874758","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115832","id":3842874758,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lDZ2G","user":{"login":"phosphorylation","id":38056156,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4MDU2MTU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38056156?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation","html_url":"https://github.com/phosphorylation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phosphorylation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-03T18:12:34Z","updated_at":"2026-02-03T18:12:34Z","body":"detailed system info:\nGodot v4.6.stable - Windows 11 (build 22631) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti SUPER (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7688) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-14700KF (28 threads) - 63.81 GiB memory","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3842874758/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3850865272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115832#issuecomment-3850865272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115832","id":3850865272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7lh4p4","user":{"login":"RyanVail","id":111651152,"node_id":"U_kgDOBqepUA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/111651152?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail","html_url":"https://github.com/RyanVail","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RyanVail/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-05T03:27:16Z","updated_at":"2026-02-05T03:27:16Z","body":"This error occurs because the thread made for `_process_logs` never has its `wait_to_finish()` method called meaning it exists while the engine's deconstructor is being called leading to weird errors.\n\nIn the docs it [says](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/performance/using_multiple_threads.html):\n> Even if the function has returned already, the thread **must** collect it, so call [Thread.wait_to_finish()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_thread.html#class-thread-method-wait-to-finish)\n\nBased on that sentence in the docs I assume even threads that are supposed to exist until the end of the program should have `wait_to_finish()` called. The docs seem to only mention that there so if this is intended I think it would be a good idea to place more warnings in the docs. I'm not sure why this issue is only occurring now but due to it being essentially a race condition it might be hard to track down.\n\nI opened a [pull request](https://github.com/albinaask/Log/pull/28) in the logger library that waits on the thread when the program exists and the error is not thrown anymore in my testing.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3850865272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]